- Qwen3 Embedding 0.6B: 1,024-dimensional embeddings; Apache-2.0; fetched by Ollama.
- BAAI bge-reranker-v2-m3: CPU reranking; Apache-2.0; included in signed packages.
- PaddleOCR-VL 1.6: document parsing/OCR; Apache-2.0; included in signed packages.
